  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759241,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 101 Pony Pets 3D - Nintendo 3DS\n\nGet ready for a heartwarming adventure with *101 Pony Pets 3D*! Adopt your very own pony and embark on a delightful journey filled with fun, friendship, and endless possibilities. Choose from over 101 unique and entertaining ponies, or collect them all!\n\nCare for your pony by teaching it tricks like dancing, jumping, and even flying. Reward your efforts with tasty treats and enter your beloved pet into exciting pet shows to earn fantastic prizes – toys, food, stylish clothing, and charming furniture!  \n\nCustomize your pony’s look with hats, glasses, shirts, and more, then showcase your creativity.  Experience the magic of 3D as you zoom, rotate, and interact with your pony in a truly immersive environment.  Enjoy a variety of fun minigames, from vet checkups and bubble baths to playful romps in the yard.  *101 Pony Pets 3D* offers a charming and engaging experience for players of all ages!"
    },
